Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.Testing contains a fixture class that does the job of
launching a local web server and furnishing a client for interacting with it. The predefined
fixture class is WebApplicationFactory<T>. The generic T argument must be instantiated
with the Startup class of your web project.
